{"word":"κακοήθης","uri":"kakoêthês","senses":[{"word":"κακοήθης","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">κακο·ήθης,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ης, ες</span>\n[<span class=\"grec\">ᾰ</span>] qui a un mauvais caractère,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> méchant, vicieux,\n<span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">εὐήθης,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ep.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">360</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">228, 27 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\nchoses,</span> détestable, <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">422</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui a de mauvaises\nhabitudes <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> qui est mal disposé pour\nfaire qqe ch. <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">401</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> de nature maligne,\nmalin, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. d’ulcères ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hpc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Aph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1256,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-έστατος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">422</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">κ. ἦθος</span>.</div>\n"}]}